WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:08.000
同一批体验名额。100 人里，有 90 人抽中。
Of 100 people, 90 got a spot in the same draw.

00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:13.000
翻到票的另一面。100 人里，有 10 人没抽中。
Turn the ticket over. Of 100 people, 10 did not get a spot.

00:00:13.000 --> 00:00:18.000
两面说的是同一批人。你先注意到的部分变了。
Both sides refer to the same group. Your first focus changed.

00:00:18.000 --> 00:00:22.500
把两种印刷叠到同一个网格上，分母一直是 100。
Overlay the two prints. The denominator stays at 100.

00:00:22.500 --> 00:00:27.000
表达方式可能影响评价，这叫框架效应。
The wording can influence evaluations. This is a framing effect.

00:00:27.000 --> 00:00:32.400
食品研究比较过“75% 瘦肉”和“25% 脂肪”两种标签。
A food study compared labels saying “75% lean” and “25% fat.”

00:00:32.400 --> 00:00:38.000
标成“75% 瘦肉”时评价更正面。品尝后，措辞影响减弱。
The “75% lean” label was rated more favorably. Tasting reduced the effect.

00:00:38.000 --> 00:00:43.900
给属性换个说法，和在确定与有风险的结果间选择，是两件事。
Relabeling an attribute and choosing between a certain and a risky outcome are different tasks.

00:00:43.900 --> 00:00:49.000
先确定比较的是谁、哪个结果、用什么分母。
First identify the group, outcome, and denominator.

00:00:49.000 --> 00:00:53.000
做决定前，把正面和反面写成同一句。
Before deciding, write both sides in one sentence.

00:00:53.000 --> 00:00:57.000
100 人里，90 人抽中，10 人没抽中。
Of 100 people, 90 got a spot and 10 did not.
